<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n19488" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">βᾰρύ̆-στομος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>,
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>heavy in
			pronunciation,</i> of the first syllable of <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σκῆπτρον,</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				Phld.
				<u>Po.</u>
				2.14
			</span></i> (dub.). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>of heavy,</i> i.e. <i>abusive, mouth,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Nonn.
				<u>D.</u>
				48.420
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b> of a weapon,
				<i>cutting deeply,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Opp.
				<u>H.</u>
				4.481
			</span></i>.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
